Open Source License
===================

yaffs2 is a NAND-flash file system by Aleph One Ltd.
Upstream: https://github.com/Aleph-One-Ltd/yaffs2
Headers in this tree are LGPL-2.1; yaffs C code is GPL-2.0.

This directory ships yaffs2 as a CLOSED-SOURCE, PREBUILT static archive
(prebuilt/libyaffs2.a) taken from the HiSilicon fbb SDK (see
prebuilt/ORIGIN.md for provenance, integrity hashes and the reproducible
e_flags normalization applied by tools/patch_eflags.py).

Redistribution and use of this archive within company-internal build
environments follows the fbb/HiSilicon SDK license terms (internal use
confirmed for this project). If the product moves to external
distribution, the archive must either be replaced by an
equivalently-licensed build from the upstream GPL-2.0 sources or the
shipment must comply with the applicable license of the SDK binary.
